(195, 1, '2025-12-19 00:05:44', '2025-12-18 17:05:44', '<h2>อาหารอร่อย</h2>					<h2>ร้อนๆ จ้า! พึ่งขึ้นจากเตา หอมฉุยเลย!</h2>		<p>สั่งอาหารไทยแสนอร่อยจากครัวบ้านเรา ปรุงสดใหม่ทุกออเดอร์ ส่งฟรีเมื่อสั่งครบ 200 บาท พร้อมส่วนลดพิเศษสำหรับลูกค้าใหม่</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M440 6.5L24 246.4c-34.4 19.9-31.1 70.8 5.7 85.9L144 379.6V464c0 46.4 59.2 65.5 86.6 28.6l43.8-59.1 111.9 46.2c5.9 2.4 12.1 3.6 18.3 3.6 8.2 0 16.3-2.1 23.6-6.2 12.8-7.2 21.6-20 23.9-34.5l59.4-387.2c6.1-40.1-36.9-68.8-71.5-48.9zM192 464v-64.6l36.6 15.1L192 464zm212.6-28.7l-153.8-63.5L391 169.5c10.7-15.5-9.5-33.5-23.7-21.2L155.8 332.6 48 288 464 48l-59.4 387.3z\"></path></svg>			\n									สั่งอาหารเลย!\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"1024\" height=\"1024\" src=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/delicious-thai-food-dishes-on-table.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/delicious-thai-food-dishes-on-table.jpg 1024w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/delicious-thai-food-dishes-on-table-300x300.jpg 300w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/delicious-thai-food-dishes-on-table-150x150.jpg 150w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/delicious-thai-food-dishes-on-table-768x768.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />																<h2>เมนูแนะนำ</h2>				\n			<article>\n					<a href=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/uncategorized/%e0%b8%82%e0%b9%89%e0%b8%b2%e0%b8%a7%e0%b8%a1%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%99%e0%b9%84%e0%b8%81%e0%b9%88/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n						<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/chicken-rice-khao-man-gai-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"ข้าวผัดผงกะหรี่ทะเล\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/chicken-rice-khao-man-gai-300x300.jpg 300w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/chicken-rice-khao-man-gai-150x150.jpg 150w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/chicken-rice-khao-man-gai-768x768.jpg 768w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/chicken-rice-khao-man-gai.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />					</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/uncategorized/%e0%b8%82%e0%b9%89%e0%b8%b2%e0%b8%a7%e0%b8%a1%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%99%e0%b9%84%e0%b8%81%e0%b9%88/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n							ข้าวผัดผงกะหรี่ทะเล						</a>\n					</h3>\n									<a href=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/uncategorized/%e0%b8%82%e0%b9%89%e0%b8%b2%e0%b8%a7%e0%b8%a1%e0%b8%b1%e0%b8%99%e0%b9%84%e0%b8%81%e0%b9%88/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n						ดูรายลละเอียดเพื่อสั่งอาหาร →					</a>\n		</article>\n				<article>\n					<a href=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/uncategorized/%e0%b9%81%e0%b8%81%e0%b8%87%e0%b9%80%e0%b8%82%e0%b8%b5%e0%b8%a2%e0%b8%a7%e0%b8%ab%e0%b8%a7%e0%b8%b2%e0%b8%99%e0%b9%84%e0%b8%81%e0%b9%88/\" rel=\"bookmark\">\n						<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/green-curry-with-chicken-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"ข้าวผัดต้มยำหมูกรอบ\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/green-curry-with-chicken-300x300.jpg 300w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/green-curry-with-chicken-150x150.jpg 150w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/green-curry-with-chicken-768x768.jpg 768w, http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/green-curry-with-chicken.jpg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />					</a>\n									<h3>\n						<a href=\"http://digiproj.sut.ac.th/wp07