 d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n									<ul><li data-start=\"338\" data-end=\"371\"><p data-start=\"340\" data-end=\"371\">เนื้อสัตว์ (กุ้ง / ไก่ / หมู)</p></li><li data-start=\"372\" data-end=\"380\"><p data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"380\">เห็ด</p></li><li data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"391\"><p data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"391\">ตะไคร้</p></li><li data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"404\"><p data-start=\"394\" data-end=\"404\">ใบมะกรูด</p></li><li data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"412\"><p data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"412\">ข่า</p></li><li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"421\"><p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"421\">พริก</p></li><li data-start=\"422\" data-end=\"432\"><p data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"432\">น้ำปลา</p></li><li data-start=\"433\" data-end=\"442\"><p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"442\">มะนาว</p></li><li data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"452\"><p data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"452\">ข้าวสวย</p></li></ul>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-2221\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-2221\" >\n					 ข้อมูลโภชนาการ \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n					